OL,3,GNEWSATwo taken to hospital after crash
OL,4,Afollowing pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Ffollowing a crash involving a vehicle
OL,8,Fthat had previously been pursued by
OL,9,Fpolice.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Police said in Leicester
OL,12,Fcity centre on Wednesday, officers came
OL,13,Facross a VW Passat, which subsequently
OL,14,Fmade off. The force said a pursuit was
OL,15,Fauthorised as the vehicle travelled
OL,16,Facross the city.
OL,18,FPursuing officers lost sight of the
OL,19,Fvehicle, but it was found a short time
OL,20,Flater at 11:25 GMT, having been
OL,21,Finvolved in a crash with an Audi A5 in
OL,22,FRed Hill Way.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
